00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:36,800
So, there's sometimes there's like either a post message based attack or some client side based flow that will take a lot of time to exploit.

62
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:40,800
And you kind of need to have your attack be hidden on your website.

63
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:43,800
And you need to be able to target the victim website.

64
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:47,800
Now, unfortunately, this doesn't happen quite as much nowadays because of same site lacks default cookies.

65
00:04:47,800 --> 00:05:00,800
You can't really embed stuff quite as simply, but in certain scenarios, you can embed this, you know, target page in an iframe on your site, distract the user with like a game of click this, click that.

66
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:05,800
And then, you know, have full enough time to fully exploit your vulnerability.

67
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:12,800
