00:32:29,860 --> 00:32:35,860
And then you say D and it says, yes, there's one, you know, so you can do like, you can really sort of character by character brute force.

566
00:32:35,860 --> 00:32:45,860
Um, codes in sort of like a cross leak scenario if the number of iframes changes, uh, based off of what is controlled by the attacker.

567
00:32:45,860 --> 00:32:46,860
Very, very cool stuff.

